# AB-008: A basic buffer absorbs an alkali challenge
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
seal v1 500mL
add v1 NH3 0.001mol
add v1 NH4Cl 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
new
add v2 water 100mL
measure v2 ph
add v1 NaOH 0.0001mol
add v2 NaOH 0.0001mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
inspect
